      <subsection name="Description" id="IllegalBlockTag_Description">
        <div>
          Detects a user-defined Javadoc block tag and reports a violation when the tag
          is present with text that does not match <code>tagTextPattern</code>.
          With the default pattern <code>^$</code> (same as <code>Regexp</code> format default;
          matches only empty content), any non-empty text of the configured tag is a
          violation. No violation is reported when there is no Javadoc or when
          <code>tag</code> is not configured.
        </div>
      </subsection>

